WEBVTT

00:52:58.256 --> 00:53:00.716
I mean, certainly for me,
what made the difference

00:53:00.740 --> 00:53:05.930
after a year of exhausted
grey and agony on this

00:53:05.954 --> 00:53:09.123
was just a very intentional decision

00:53:09.147 --> 00:53:11.744
to carry Zoe forward,

00:53:11.768 --> 00:53:14.313
to hold her alive, to be inspired by her,

00:53:14.337 --> 00:53:16.190
to be excited by her,

00:53:16.214 --> 00:53:20.023
and to imagine her sparkle
and her generosity and so forth,

00:53:20.047 --> 00:53:21.278
in everything.

00:53:21.302 --> 00:53:24.328
And many other people felt the same,

00:53:24.352 --> 00:53:29.175
and I think you can make a case
that that is our task

00:53:29.199 --> 00:53:31.115
when someone who we love goes,